MAGNETICS CONSTRUCTION
Text Notes 19110 8470 0    60   ~ 0
identity per docs/magnetics.md (turns, gap, litz, acceptance lines live there)
Text Notes 19100 8900 0    60   ~ 0
D3 T1A/T1B (E67 rev D): 2 cells, primaries in series -> n 2; each 2x E70/33/32 (B66372B2000), 6:6||6, pri litz 3850x0.063 + sec foil 0.10x28 halves, Lm 28uH/cell +/-7%, Bpk 159mT, BONDED
Text Notes 19100 9200 0    60   ~ 0
D2 L1R (E67 rev F): external Lr 5.16uH +/-3%, 2x E70/33/32, N=5, litz 8000x0.05, distributed gap, bonded
Text Notes 19100 9500 0    60   ~ 0
D8 LFA/LFB: bank filter = D6-30 construction at DC duty, 2x T48 60u N=7 foil 20mm2 -> 7.4uH
Text Notes 19100 9800 0    60   ~ 0
total Lr = D2 + 2x cell leakage (acceptance +/-30%) + 0.1uH loop = +/-5% simulated; Cr at TANK
Text Notes 19100 10100 0    60   ~ 0
bond loss screened by the EOL bonded thermal soak (T_XFMR NTC rise at fixed load, E65)
